WEBVTT

00:00:21.626 --> 00:00:23.472
<v><b>A:</b></v> No, I think I’ll be OK.

00:00:24.639 --> 00:00:25.835
<v><b>B:</b></v> I’ll get you a cab.

00:00:37.441 --> 00:00:38.779
<v><b>A:</b></v> So are you coming?

00:00:39.766 --> 00:00:41.714
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yeah, I’m coming.

00:00:42.754 --> 00:00:43.462
See you later.

00:00:55.083 --> 00:00:55.664
<v><b>A:</b></v> What’s wrong?

00:00:57.212 --> 00:00:59.561
<v><b>B:</b></v> Just out of breath.

00:01:11.108 --> 00:01:12.348
<v><b>A:</b></v> What’s the matter with your back?

00:01:13.359 --> 00:01:14.492
<v><b>B:</b></v> It’s nothing serious.

00:01:26.079 --> 00:01:28.330
<v><b>A:</b></v> You and Max were running like it was the Olympics.

00:01:33.262 --> 00:01:34.375
<v><b>B:</b></v> I don’t know what you mean.